            "children": [
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "The first cross-media creation from Marjorie, the literary master famous throughout Belobog."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "The brand-new fantasy show"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Roadside Picnic"
              },
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "from the Golden Theater's Drama Department"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Will officially open on November 5 at the Golden Theater."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Tickets and limited merchandise will be available at the counter."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-d1f1b08cc3817bfb"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Binder with the cover of"
              },
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Roadside Picnic"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The cover of the binder is printed with the poster of"
              },
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Roadside Picnic"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The size of the binder perfectly matches the size of the program, with a great storage capacity of 30 pages."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Practical and highly memorable, suitable for storing piles of programs you get from the theater."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "List price: 1500 shield"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-1b60e685a8c27b20"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Roadside Picnic"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "— Mole Kingdom's Roundtable Meeting theme frame"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Modeled after the mole kingdom palace's council chamber backdrop."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "A special release for audience that love the theater with programs and ticket display cards pre-reserved."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "You can decorate your wall with the program of"
              },
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Roadside Picnic"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "along with your ticket!"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "List price: 3,000 shield"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-547aea0f2a7ba1eb"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Roadside Picnic"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Official Script Book"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Licensed official merchandise with every line from the play."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "A legendary creation that surpasses media boundaries, written by the legendary Belobog literary master Marjorie."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Re-live the wonderful story in the live performance. A must-have for all"
              },
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Roadside Picnic"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "lovers!"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "List price: 5000 shield"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-629f1f76479a8cc5"
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
